 "notes": [
  "Twelve-month column of the Q4-2023 release (8-K 2024-02-08).",
  "Engineering Solutions sold May 2, 2023 (results through that date). Loss on disposition $120M pre-tax ($183M after-tax per Q4 release; Q2/Q3 releases printed $186M after-tax) in Corporate Unallocated; gains on disposition MI $46M, Indices $4M.",
  "IS \"Other expense (income), net\" printed 15 (expense) -> oth_inc -15. \"Loss (gain) on dispositions\" 70 -> gain_disp -70.",
  "Exhibit 5 \"Adjusted Other (Income) Expense\" shows a non-GAAP adjustment of (23) (other expense 19 -> adjusted other income (4)) with no footnote describing it and no after-tax amount. The FY2024 10-K (Note: retirement plans) identifies a $23M pre-tax non-cash U.S. retirement plan pension settlement charge in 2023. Item recorded with pre 23 and net omitted (not printed); hence start_ni (2,626) + items_net + amort check does not tie (missing after-tax pension amount); the printed aggregate after-tax line (items_total_net) does tie.",
  "Tax item: tax benefit of $16M associated with a disposition (footnote k) recorded as TAX net -16 (no pre-tax).",
  "Exhibit 6 (h) aggregate twelve-month items: IHS Markit merger costs 236 (179 after-tax), employee severance 184 (139), acquisition-related costs 77 (76), loss on dispositions 70 (130, net of the $16M tax benefit), disposition-related costs 24 (21), lease impairments 14 (10), asset impairments 9 (7), asset write-off 1 (1); total pre-tax 615.",
  "Items with after-tax \"less than $1 million\" (MI asset write-off $1M) recorded with net 0.",
  "ngaap.items_total_pre = operating-level \"Non-GAAP adjustments\" (615); other expense adjustment 23 and interest adjustment 27 (premium amortization benefit) printed separately. items_total_net/ps = 560 / 1.75: 2,626 + 560 + 833 = 4,019.",
  "Segment rounding: Ratings 1,864+11+8=1,883 vs adj 1,882; Indices 925+5+36=966 vs adj 967.",
  "Non-GAAP adjusted tax line: non-GAAP adjustments 52, deal-related amortization 264. adj_oth_inc = adjusted other (income) expense printed (9) -> +9.",
  "Prior-year (2022) comparatives in this release are pro forma (IHS Markit merger as of 1-Jan-2021) for non-GAAP measures.",
  "FY2024 guidance is recorded in Q4-23.json."
 ],
